RQ("CZ11","P12","The word ‘recall’, as used in the passage, means:",["remember","call back a faulty product","deny","telephone again"],"Successful people ‘recall’ — remember — where their love of learning began.");
RQ("CZ11","P13","The word ‘untouched’, as used in the passage, means:",["not dealt with","clean and pure","never handled by hand","unknown"],"The causes are ‘left untouched’ — nobody tackles them.");
RQ("CZ11","P14","The word ‘modest’, as used in the passage, means:",["small","shy","humble in manner","decent in dress"],"A ‘modest budget’ is a small one; the other senses describe people.");
RQ("CZ11","P15","The phrase ‘a fraction of’, as used in the passage, means:",["a small part of","double","a broken piece of","exactly half of"],"Copies sell at a fraction of the price — at a small part of it.");
RQ("CZ11","P16","The word ‘insist’, as used in the passage, means:",["state firmly","suggest lightly","wonder","deny"],"Experts insist — they say firmly — that a human must decide.");
RQ("CZ11","P17","The word ‘verify’, as used in the passage, means:",["confirm","change","switch off","sell"],"Drivers verify their phone number — they confirm it is theirs.");
